# Riddles in the Dark: "You may split the cards into one pile of four and one pile of zero" (the ruling). Bot1 puts all four cards face-up, leaving the face-down pile
# empty, and Bot2 takes the empty face-down pile for Bot1: Bot1 gets nothing and the four cards (Lightning Bolt, Island, Counterspell, Plains) go to its graveyard. The
# top four are the same as in the other Riddles scenarios.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Riddles in the Dark
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Counterspell
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Riddles in the Dark.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot2.Modes(Face-down pile)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Riddles in the Dark; Plains; Counterspell; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
